/T (SpaceLoop can evolve into a production-grade modular monolith with Next.js + TypeScript on the frontend and FastAPI + PostgreSQL on the backend, using Redis for caching, sessions, rate-limiting and background queues, and OpenSearch for advanced location/AI-powered search. Add S3/R2 for images and documents, Celery for background jobs, Docker + GitHub Actions for CI/CD, and OIDC/Keycloak + MFA/passkeys for authentication. Later integrate real payment gateways, automated host payouts, maps, notifications, monitoring with Sentry/OpenTelemetry, and stronger AI-based recommendations, fraud detection and condition verification.)
/E (SpaceLoop can evolve into a production-grade modular monolith with Next.js + TypeScript on the frontend and FastAPI + PostgreSQL on the backend, using Redis for caching, sessions, rate-limiting and background queues, and OpenSearch for advanced location/AI-powered search. Add S3/R2 for images and documents, Celery for background jobs, Docker + GitHub Actions for CI/CD, and OIDC/Keycloak + MFA/passkeys for authentication. Later integrate real payment gateways, automated host payouts, maps, notifications, monitoring with Sentry/OpenTelemetry, and stronger AI-based recommendations, fraud detection and condition verification.)
